/* TabHero（Figma 642:448）：竹林插画 + 衬线标题 30/40 + 一句副标题 13/20；插画底边米纸色与页面衔接。 */
:host {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
}

.p3-tab-hero {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  width: 100%;
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.p3-tab-hero__sky {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  background: var(--p3-mist);
}

.p3-tab-hero__art {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 190px;
}

.p3-tab-hero__title {
  position: absolute;
  left: 48rpx;
  right: 48rpx;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 60rpx;
  line-height: 80rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.p3-tab-hero__subtitle {
  position: absolute;
  left: 48rpx;
  right: 48rpx;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
